SUMMARY:IMPROMPTU LI - Hills around Speedwell Forge (26R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n## Details\n\nRide Leader
 : Bruce Black\n\nIt will be a warm ride but hopefully we will beat the hea
 t. It still should be a good day for a ride and some food.\n\nAn enjoyable
  ride from Lititz exploring the hills around Speedwell Forge. We will stop
  at the Lititz location of New Holland Coffee Shop for food/beverage. The 
 pace will be 14 - 16 mph average. Multiple regroup points (like 4 or 5). P
 lease park in the upper parking lot of the library.\n\nThis ride is a soci
 al ride\, but cyclists are not expected to stay in one group. Cyclists may
  pedal at their own comfortable paces. Please be supportive of the other c
 yclists to avoid anyone biking alone or being dropped off the back of the 
 last group.\n\nCue and Ride with GPS links:\n[LI - Hills around Speedwell 
 Forge (26R)](https://ridewithgps.com/routes/54567966?privacy_code=U5ABRfuV
 wYacNFGNifwY41RUt5fl5zJx)\n\nHelmets are mandatory\; please also plan to b
 ring 1-2 water bottles\, and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\
 , pump/CO2 inflator).\nBeing a Meetup Member does not mean you are a club 
 member. Use this link to join the club.\n[https://www.lancasterbikeclub.ne
 t/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.ne
 t/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your agreement to 
 abide by the club's Code of Conduct [https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/
 content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984](https://lancbikec
 lub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=32398
 4)\nand Rules of the Road\n[https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.a
 spx?](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id
 =257148&module_id=325159)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3156810
 73/
