SUMMARY:TDRR #13 Weekend Long Ride\, Quarryville Quest (41H)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nSweep: Rachel Cardazone\n
 \nCelebrate the Tour de France and ride our Tour de Red Rose as a tribute 
 to the event. This year you can win prizes just by RSVPing on Meetup and R
 iding our Rides!\n\nFull Details on Our TdRR Page: [LBC's Tour de Red Rose
  Page](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=25714
 8&module_id=326153)\n\nTdRR ride details & start location are on the [TdRR
  Schedule](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=2
 57148&module_id=340196).\n\nCue & GPX File: [Cue & GPX Files](https://rout
 es.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/lc-quarryville-quest-41h/) **Update July 1st 
 to get our of the city without being on King Street.**\n-The Daily Grind c
 offee shop is 3 blocks off the route on Bank Ave in Quarryville.\n-You can
  flatten out the middle of the ride by taking the Enola Low Grade Trail We
 st from the East State Str trailhead to Hollow Rd.\n\nTour de Red Rose & L
 BC Notes:\n\nCheck Google Groups for Ride Conditions\, Route Changes and W
 eather Updates. [Join here](https://groups.google.com/forum/?hl=en#!forum/
 lancasterbikeclub) if you are not already part of this group.\n\nHelmets a
 re mandatory\; please also plan to bring 1-2 water bottles\, and basic rep
